# SCINTX Gateway environment variables (#41, #73)
# Copy to .env and adjust, or export before `make run` / `./bin/scintx`.

# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Gateway Server & Policy Settings
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------

# Listen address for the gateway HTTP server. Default: :8080
SCINTX_ADDR=:8080

# Optional path to gateway YAML config file. Default: ./gateway.yaml (if present)
# SCINTX_CONFIG=./gateway.yaml

# Gateway instance identifier recorded in Aggregate Reports. Default: gateway-001
# SCINTX_INSTANCE_ID=gateway-001

# Default policy evaluated when a submission omits the "policy" field.
# Default: baseline-security
SCINTX_DEFAULT_POLICY=baseline-security

# Directory containing source-controlled YAML policy files. Default: ./policies
SCINTX_POLICIES_DIR=./policies

# Optional Bearer token required from consumers calling /v1/* endpoints (#67).
# Supports *_FILE for container secret mounts.
# SCINTX_AUTH_BEARER_TOKEN=
# SCINTX_AUTH_BEARER_TOKEN_FILE=/run/secrets/scintx_bearer_token

# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Provider Adapter Settings & Credentials (#73)
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------

# OSV.dev adapter ("osv"). Public OSV requires no credentials.
# SCINTX_OSV_BASE_URL=https://api.osv.dev
# Optional bearer token for authenticated OSV mirrors:
# SCINTX_OSV_BEARER_TOKEN=
# SCINTX_OSV_BEARER_TOKEN_FILE=

# Sonatype OSS Index / Guide Compatibility API adapter ("ossindex").
# Requires a Sonatype Guide token. If unset, the gateway starts normally and
# records ossindex with available=false and reason="missing_credentials" (#68, #73).
# SCINTX_OSSINDEX_BASE_URL=https://ossindex.sonatype.org
# SCINTX_OSSINDEX_USERNAME=scintx
# SCINTX_OSSINDEX_TOKEN=
# SCINTX_OSSINDEX_TOKEN_FILE=/run/secrets/ossindex_token

# Set to 1 to run OSV against deterministic built-in fixtures without network calls (#41).
# SCINTX_DEMO_FIXTURES=0
